,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastDialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.26,0:00:02.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 1,0:00:01.6