,0,fx,lDialogue: 1,0:01:26.23,0:01:32.67,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.24,0:01:32.68,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.25,0:01:32.69,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.26,0:01:32.70,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.27,0:01:32.71,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.28,0:01:32.72,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:01:26.29,0:01:32.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:26.30,0:01:32.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.31,0:01:32.75,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:01:26.32,0:01:32.76,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:26.33,0:01:32.77,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.34,0:01:32.78,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 1,0:01:26.35,0:01:32.79,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 1,0:01:26.36,0:01:32.80,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:01:26.37,0:01:32.81,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.38,0:01:32.82,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 1,0:01:26.39,0:01:32.83,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.84,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 1,0:01:26.41,0:01:32.85,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin! I'll put you out of your misery with my own hands!Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.65,0:01:44.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Semla...Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.71,0:02:05.01,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:07.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Se...Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.89,0:02:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Jorl!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.11,Main,,0,0,0,,m...Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,la!Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Waterfall Beard-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Jorl-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:43.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Semla!Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:45.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire in the village!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:51.05,Main,,0,0,0,,– Catch her already! – Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.05,0:02:53.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt her!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you make some semla?Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,There's some for the Festival in the village storehouse!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.45,0:02:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring them now!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:00.65,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.35,0:03:12.62,Main,,0,0,0,,– Mother, what are you doing?! – It's dangerous!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay back!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.82,0:03:28.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Gebur...Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:54.01,Main,,0,0,0,,tstag!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:54.01,Note,,0,0,0,,Gerburtstag - BirthdayDialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I shall give you a voice.Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.40,0:04:11.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.81,0:04:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Heed my command.Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.57,0:04:29.60,Main,,0,0,0,,– There's a face in the fire! – What?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm scared...Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's like a demon!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:38.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Your name is Pandora!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I brought it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and feed her!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:47.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Semla!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.28,0:04:49.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It's delicious! It's delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Simmer down!Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:26.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The fire...Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,is gone.Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,How cute!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.18,0:05:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hi, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:37.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Worked a miracle...Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:43.19,Main,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't me.Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:48.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The Sun God calmed this disaster.Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:06:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Punish her... She is not just a child...Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.19,0:06:08.18,Main,,0,0,0,,If we don't do something now... she'll bring even more disaster in the future!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.22,Main,,0,0,0,,– Jorl-sama! – Quick, help him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Mountain Beard-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:18.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Please forgive her!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.19,0:06:35.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You're trying to stop me, Carmel?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.61,0:06:41.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Jorl has been my companion in battle for 300 years.Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.91,0:06:49.49,Main,,0,0,0,,He's too old. I don't think he'll survive this time.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:55.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Being a warrior isn't about living long... It's about how you die!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.42,0:06:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We have to bring it to an end...Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:03.36,Main,,0,0,0,,We cannot forgive those who defy Elbaf’s laws.Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:07.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand! But even if she can't be forgiven,Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:11.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin is a poor child who was abandoned.Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:15.20,Main,,0,0,0,,She is now under the care of the Sheep's House!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,I cannot abandon her!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,What will you do with her?Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:27.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I will take her and leave this place!Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:30.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Carmel!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Mountain Beard-sama! You must kill Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.08,0:07:43.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Why should we pardon her after she's done such a horrible thing?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.15,0:07:45.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What has happened to your Elbaf pride?Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.97,0:08:01.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright then, why don't you get out of my sight now?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.49,0:08:06.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:07.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Hajrudin!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:12.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Let go!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened to Waterfall Beard-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He died.Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:28.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Doesn't she remember?Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:33.53,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Jorl, the hero of the Giants, died...Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:39.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And between the devastation of Linlin and Carmel's miracle...Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:44.12,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The events of that day...Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:50.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,spread far and wide through the few settlements of Giants around the world...Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:55.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,With the orphans of the Sheep's House, who couldn't stand to be separated from their mother...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.30,0:09:00.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,along with the Giants' new sworn enemy, Charlotte Linlin in tow...Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:04.54,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmel left Elbaf.Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.54,0:09:10.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And then they began a new life at a new Sheep's House.Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.30,0:09:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It's done! Is this good enough?Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.80,0:09:17.36,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all we need. I'm sorry for asking these favors.Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Without your help, there's no way we'd have a house this far into the mountains.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.75,0:09:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it. To be honest, I don't wanna see Linlin's face,Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,but you're the Holy Mother to us Giants too, Carmel. Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,If you ever need us, say the word!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.58,0:09:43.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,To put the worried children at ease, Carmel began to smile even more.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.06,0:09:47.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:53.25,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A few days after leaving Elbaf, things were just as they used to be...Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Linlin's gonna kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:58.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:03.95,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And the Sheep's House was filled with the children's laughter once more.Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:05.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Look after the house while I'm away.Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll clean the bathroom!Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do the laundry!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.20,Main,,0,0,0,,When will you be back?Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.20,0:10:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be back once I finish buying our groceries.Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:18.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you need anything?Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.48,0:10:20.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Shortcake!Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.89,0:10:23.68,Main,,0,0,0,,– A set of cards! – Toy swords for samurai fighting!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,See you, Mother! Take care!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,To the rest of the world, the Sheep's House...Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.68,0:10:40.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Was a place where the pious mother would miraculously reform troubled children...Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.83,Narrator,,0,0,0,,until they were ready for a good home...Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.51,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right on time...Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:59.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course. Have I ever stood you up?Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get to business.Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:10.90,Main,,0,0,0,,There is a good girl.Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd leave Elbaf...Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.48,0:11:24.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I had to. I didn't want to give this girl up.Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Think about it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:44.60,Main,,0,0,0,,At just five years old she was able to destroy half of an Elbaf village.Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.66,Main,,0,0,0,,But the price you're asking for is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you can pay it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.98,0:11:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,If she were in the Navy, she could one day be an admiral or even a Fleet Admiral.Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,If she were in Cipher Pol, she'd be a great shield for the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been in the kid-trafficking business for 50 years.Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And this girl's the finest product I've ever had!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:12.21,Main,,0,0,0,,After pulling that stunt with the Navy 37 years ago, I was able to live on Elbaf.Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:18.02,Main,,0,0,0,,And got you guys the first-ever Giant recruit for the Navy... John Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That was all thanks to me!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.91,0:12:25.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I run the Sheep's House nice and clean, and those kids have no idea...Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:30.15,Main,,0,0,0,,that I've been selling the liveliest of them to the Government every 2 years.Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Orphans make good spies, right?Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:36.30,Main,,0,0,0,,They've got no history to trace!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:39.37,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! All right! I'll get you your money!Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.12,0:12:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course you will!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,It ain't easy being a Holy Mother.Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:52.59,Captions,,0,0,0,,Orphan Seller Mother Carmel (Code Name: Mountain Witch)Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:52.34,Main,,0,0,0,,I think I'll take the chance to retire after this one...Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,So this'll be my last deal. I need you to pay me in full.Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:04.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you all wanna sing today?Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.35,0:13:06.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Binks' Sake!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Really? But that's a pirates' song.Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:12.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! We're gonna be pirates someday!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds cool!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:21.87,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Making a delivery, bringing it across the seaDialogue: 0,0:13:21.87,0:13:25.95,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Binks' sake in the hold as we sail through the breezeDialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:30.25,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Far across the eye can see, the sun is shining merrilyDialogue: 0,0:13:30.25,0:13:32.05,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As the birds fly in the sky as they sing out with gleeDialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As the birds fly in the sky as they sing out with gleeDialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:37.09,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,You'll be sold to the Government before you get the chance to become pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:38.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Bid adieu to everyone, so long to port renownedDialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:42.89,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Sailing on from dusk 'til dawn and singing out as oneDialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:47.27,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross the gold and silver waves, changing into water spraysDialogue: 0,0:13:47.27,0:13:52.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Sailing out on our journey to the ends of the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.55,0:13:55.25,Main,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:14:00.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday, Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:57.20,Note,,0,0,0,,Cake reads "Happy Birthday Linlin".Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:06.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:12.02,Main,,0,0,0,,We know how much you love semla, Linlin.... So we made a croquembouche out of it!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:13.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope it's good!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,It's called croquembouche? It looks delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's have a tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,A tea party?Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:29.82,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll spend time gracefully sitting around tables, drinking tea, and eating sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,That sounds great! I wanna have that! A tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:35.80,Main,,0,0,0,,– Let's make tea. – Join us, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.38,0:14:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's start!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.76,Main,,0,0,0,,– Eat as much as you want! – Eat, eat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:49.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh! Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.35,0:14:57.35,Main,,0,0,0,,She eats so fast!Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.32,0:15:03.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The tea party's fun!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy! It's so delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:13.29,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One day, Mother Carmel simply vanished.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:19.38,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And it happened on the very best birthday that Linlin had ever had.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:29.09,Narrator,,0,0,0,,She was with her friends at the Sheep's House, kids who'd been through the same hardships...Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:32.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And her beloved, kindhearted mother.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.31,0:15:39.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Surrounded by all those smiles, and eating her delicious, sweet birthday cake...Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:43.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Linlin was unable to hold back her tears.Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:45.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat as much as you like, Linlin.Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eat... I'll eat it all!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:54.07,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful day it was... She couldn't even see through her tears.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:15:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, don't rush, Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,We made it for you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:02.96,Main,,0,0,0,,It's all for you, Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat more!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's stay friends!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's stay together and have fun!Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.89,0:16:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:21.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:25.91,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What a truly wonderful birthday.Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:27.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:33.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy! I was eating so much, that I even chewed off a bit of the table.Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:39.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone! I'll never forget this day for the rest of my...Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone?Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:51.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother?Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.20,0:16:54.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One day, Mother Carmel...Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:56.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did they go?Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,suddenly vanished.Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:02.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:05.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you?! Everyone! Are you in the house?Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:19.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:23.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:26.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.81,0:17:34.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.29,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:46.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me all alone...Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:52.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Where are you, everyone?Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:09.22,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Why did you just vanish?Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.60,0:18:24.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Where did you go....Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:27.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:35.05,Narrator,,0,0,0,,63 years ago, Mother Carmel and the other children simply vanished.Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Even Big Mom herself did not know the truth of what happened...Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:43.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,but there were two people who witnessed the whole thing...Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.98,0:18:51.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,One was a warrior of Elbaf who was worried about the Sheep's House....Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.27,Narrator,,0,0,0,,so he came to check on them.Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.97,0:18:56.20,Main,,0,0,0,,M-Monster!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:59.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The Giant went pale and took off running...Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.16,0:19:02.94,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and never returned to the island.Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:10.03,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Eventually, news of this day spread to Elbaf, and then to all the Giants in the world...Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.45,0:19:16.20,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and from that point onward, the name "Charlotte Linlin" became so hated...Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:20.34,Narrator,,0,0,0,,that no Giant would utter her name.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:26.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?! Mother! Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:30.22,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the other witness...Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:35.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,was a failed piratical cook who'd wound up living on the island...Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.30,0:19:37.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,His name was Streusen.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:46.01,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He found it to be very entertaining.Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:03.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He had the ability...Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:06.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,to turn any object into food.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:09.26,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his Cook-Cook Fruit.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a monster like that before.Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.89,0:20:22.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me alone...Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.54,0:20:26.98,Main,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she's gonna die. What a waste that'd be.Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you go, Mother?Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:41.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter, little girl?Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.46,0:20:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,If you keep crying, you're just going to get hungrier.Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:50.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Say, little girl, shall we talk about your dreams?Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you, old man?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't come too close.Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:59.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man, have you seen Mother? Do you know where everyone's gone?Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:03.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know... But I bet they'll come back soon.Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You think so?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll stay with you until then.Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.64,0:21:12.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a good chef. You won't go hungry with me around.Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:19.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry...Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.98,0:21:42.48,Main,,0,0,0,,See?Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:49.07,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It was the meeting of these two that led to the formation of the Big Mom Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.04,0:22:09.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.21,0:22:12.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to your senses! They're going to shoot you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:16.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So, at the Tea Party today,Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:21.17,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,if we break that picture in half, what do you think will happen?Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:23.60,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Mama will be devastated!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.60,0:22:28.61,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And no one there will be able to move for more than five seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.61,0:22:32.82,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Then the KX Launcher will show its real strength...Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.11,0:22:37.49,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and the Emperor, Big Mom, will die!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.64,0:22:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You're doomed, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.64,0:22:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.64,0:23:09.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mother.Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.92,0:23:13.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They're all trying to stop me.Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:23.91,Main,,0,0,0,,People are happiest when they're equal.Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:29.59,Main,,0,0,0,,But in today's world, a country like that is nearly impossible to find.Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.59,0:23:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why we should start our own country here!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:37.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It'll be a country where everyone is equal!Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:39.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Country?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. A place where all races can coexist in peace.Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:46.10,Main,,0,0,0,,And where everyone will be at the same eye level!Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.85,0:23:49.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The same eye level? That sounds great!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.12,0:23:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Then everyone can be big like me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.07,0:23:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! How cool!Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:23:59.65,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a beautiful dream, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.54,0:24:08.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.64,0:24:13.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, let's work hard together.Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.87,0:24:15.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.78,Main,,0,0,0,,– Me too! – Me too!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.78,0:24:18.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.40,0:24:21.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's create a country of dreams right here!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.33,0:24:23.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best too, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:26.72,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a good girl, Linlin.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.28,0:24:28.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I am!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.60,0:24:33.95,Main,,0,0,0,,If there were countries like that, the world would be a much more peaceful place.Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.95,0:24:38.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone would be able to find happiness.Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.24,0:24:45.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Mother's dream was my dream!Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.90,0:24:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Peace? Is that your dream, Linlin?Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:56.75,Main,,0,0,0,,It is! I'm gonna build a country that Mother would like!Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.32,0:25:13.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop crying already?Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.14,0:25:17.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey! I wanna see Mother's magic!Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.73,0:25:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Magic?Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.74,0:25:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she was good at doing magic tricks.Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.95,0:25:26.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I think she put out her hands like this...Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.62,0:25:30.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Then...Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.22,0:25:38.84,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Flower, flower! Flower, flower!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.84,0:25:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! It's the trick that Mother used to do! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:44.38,Main,,0,0,0,,How come I can do it?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.38,0:25:49.20,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Flower, flower! Flower, flower! Flower, flower!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:50.85,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Earth!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:53.77,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,– Earth! – Flower, flower!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.94,0:26:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,What the... Is that a Devil Fruit power?Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.44,0:26:05.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,– Flower, flower! Flower, flower! – Tree! Tree!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, I was able to do it too, Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.92,0:26:23.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Linlin! Let's sing together!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,How interesting! All right, I've decided.Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.40,0:26:27.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna set out to sea with her!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.30,0:26:31.94,Main,,0,0,0,,– Nice! Nice! – A country where everyone is the same size...Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.94,0:26:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,and sits at the same eye level, and where everyone is equal.Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.16,0:26:42.99,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, Linlin. Let's build that country of dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.48,0:26:45.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Count me in.Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.91,0:26:47.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.27,0:26:54.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this wanted poster!Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.28,0:26:57.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Fifty million just for a little kid?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.74,0:27:00.54,Main,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.86,0:27:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,A little girl destroyed the castle?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.20,0:27:09.50,Main,,0,0,0,,The culprit is Charlotte Linlin!Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.50,0:27:15.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol reported that she's dangerous! She'll become a powerful force someday!Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.24,0:27:16.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Catch her at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:18.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.93,0:27:24.31,Main,,0,0,0,,There she is!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.44,0:27:28.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Linlin.Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.90,0:27:32.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm eating sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.60,0:27:49.24,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Charlotte Linlin continued wreaking havoc...Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:55.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,and became a worldwide threat seemingly overnight.Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.45,0:27:57.12,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.24,0:28:00.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:08.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring me all the sweets you have!Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.70,0:28:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.20,0:28:11.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:17.38,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I'll guarantee you peace and a country of dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.38,0:28:22.74,Main,,0,0,0,,If you do as I say, then everyone will be happy!Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.74,0:28:28.21,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Those who disobey are just being selfish, so I'll have to kill them!Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.34,0:28:32.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mother, I miss you...Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.47,0:28:35.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I miss you!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.44,0:28:41.23,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Mother!Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.84,0:28:44.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll make everyone big someday!Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.77,0:28:48.36,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Then we'll sit at the table together again!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:54.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But there are still people who won't listen to me!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.99,0:29:01.93,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'm so sad and can't stop crying!Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:07.50,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Because the only existing portrait of Mother...Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.50,0:29:09.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're a good girl.Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.59,0:29:18.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,The one and only portrait of Mother that was precious to me...Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.18,0:29:21.68,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,was broken by them!Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:29.73,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll make them pay...Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.11,0:29:34.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Those Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.91,0:29:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive them!Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.98,0:30:20.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The plan has failed!Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.21,0:30:28.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,They failed!Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.76,0:30:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, since I can fly, I'll plunge on to the site with a mirror to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.43,0:30:45.06,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Once you finish, dive into Caesar's mirror quickly!Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.46,0:30:48.10,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Well, here comes my part!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:51.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She destroyed my launchers!Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.80,0:30:56.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That monstrous hag! She's definitely an Emperor of the Sea!Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.71,0:31:11.88,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Retreat, everyone! Jump into the mirror!Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.24,0:31:34.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What incredible wind pressure!Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.19,0:32:22.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,This is bad! We're stuck on the roof! There's no way to escape!Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:27.87,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,And there's no way to win, either!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Rook: In Voller Größe!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.80,0:32:42.75,Note,,0,0,0,,Full-Scale RookDialogue: 0,0:33:07.09,0:33:08.39,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:51.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Father!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.67,0:33:58.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, cool!Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.67,0:33:58.86,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Infoboxes & Title:  Datenshi  Karaoke  & Visual Effects: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll